  "cited_article_id": "configure-roles-and-permissions",
  "reply": "To restrict front‑desk staff from payroll and financial records while keeping scheduling access, go to **Settings > Practice Staff > Roles & Permissions**. Create a new role (or edit an existing one) and toggle the permissions: enable the scheduling-related options and disable any *Billing* or *Financial* categories. Then click **Assign Users**, select the front‑desk team members, and **Save Changes**. Ensure each user’s account is active; if they still can’t see the correct menus, have them clear their browser cache and log in again."
}
